Package: DCIi1
Type: Package
Title: I1 Mean-Change Testing and DCI Candidate Detection
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nachiketas", "Waychal", email = "nachiketas.waychal@yahoo.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = "S. P. Jain Institute of Management and Research, Mumbai, India"),
    person("Arnab Kumar", "Laha", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "Indian Institute of Management Ahmedabad, Ahmedabad, India"),
    person("Ankur", "Sinha", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "Indian Institute of Management Ahmedabad, Ahmedabad, India"))
Description: Computes the I1 statistic for mean changes and generates
    multiple candidate change locations using adaptive contrasts and local
    interquartile scaling. Provides empirical I1 p-values for independent
    Gaussian series of length 100 with full-window parameter 22, statistic-only
    analysis for other settings, and weighted and unweighted segmentation
    covering scores. DCI candidate detection is descriptive and does not
    assign significance to selected segments. Based on the methodology of
    Waychal, Laha and Sinha (2026) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2610.23476>.
